    return 0;
}
```
Note: The random number generator is seeded with the current time, so the output will be different each run. Also note that this code doesn't handle integer overflow when adding up numbers larger than INT_MAX. It will behave unexpectedly if the sum of the three random numbers is greater than 2^31 - 1 (INT_MAX).
